Backbone & Normalization & Placement & Routing collapse? \\
\midrule
MOMENT-small & RevIN (affine=False) + LayerNorm & Pre-encoder (before patching) & Yes ($H{=}0.000$) \\
MOMENT-large & RevIN (affine=False) + LayerNorm & Pre-encoder (before patching) & Yes ($H{=}0.000$) \\
