\label{tab:topk}
\small
\begin{tabular}{@{}lcccc@{}}
\toprule
Sparsity ($k$) & Active experts & Active expert FLOPs & Test MSE & $\Delta$ vs Dense \\
\midrule
$k{=}1$ & 1/5 & 20\% & $1.268 \pm 0.072$ & $+130\%$ \\
