\toprule
Method & Latency (ms) & Peak GPU (MB) & Adapter params \\
\midrule
Backbone only & $44.3$ & $374$ & --- \\
Single adapter (conv) & $44.9$ & $375$ & $268$K \\
\textbf{RR-MoA (Top-2, $K{=}5$)} & $\mathbf{49.2}$ & $\mathbf{377}$ & $\mathbf{426}$\textbf{K} \\
\midrule
\rowcolor{gray!8} DLinear (no backbone) & $0.06$ & $173$ & $49$K \\
\bottomrule
